	(text "On-board MAP sensor, as rusEFI AlphaX-4chan (MAP.kicad_sch): NXP MPXHZ6400AC6T1, 20-400 kPa absolute,\n5 V from +5VA, 100 nF at Vs, Vout straight to M1 IN_MAP3 (S19). The M1 input has its own divider and filter.\nFirmware: map.sensor.hwChannel = H144_IN_MAP3, type MT_MPXH6400. Run a hose from the port to the intake manifold."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
